WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.567
Cybersecurity training. Module 10. Security and HIPAA together.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.900
The Security Rule asks for administrative, physical and technical safeguards,

3
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.700
and your daily habits are part of all three.

4
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:20.100
Strong passwords and a second sign-in step are a technical safeguard.

5
00:00:20.433 --> 00:00:25.300
Locking the screen and a tidy desk are a physical safeguard.

6
00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:30.133
Spotting phishing, reporting and training are administrative safeguards.

7
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:36.433
A convincing email gets a click, and a password is typed into a fake page.

8
00:00:36.767 --> 00:00:41.433
The attacker signs in as you, and no second step stops them.

9
00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:46.200
They read, copy or lock information the account can reach.

10
00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:52.400
When it is noticed, the organization may have to notify the client, patients and HHS.

11
00:00:53.600 --> 00:01:00.367
Waiting a day to be sure is not neutral. It uses time that belongs to the client.

12
00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:06.000
A breach counts as discovered on the first day anyone in the workforce knows.

13
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.100
Report it today.

14
00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:09.067
Pause.

15
00:01:09.467 --> 00:01:10.300
Verify.

16
00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:11.767
Report fast.

17
00:01:12.167 --> 00:01:13.900
Now read the module.
